    metaDescription: "Stuck for something to post? Here are 30 Facebook post ideas for small businesses, grouped by goal, each with a simple example you can adapt today.",
    excerpt: "Thirty practical Facebook post ideas for small business Pages, grouped by what you want the post to do, with a short example for each so you can start writing right away.",
