    metaDescription: "Use AI to write Facebook posts faster without losing your voice. Learn what to tell the AI, how to edit its drafts, and how to avoid common mistakes.",
    excerpt: "AI can draft Facebook posts in seconds, but it needs good instructions and a careful human edit. Here is how to get natural posts that still sound like your business.",
